DESCRIPTION:National Peanut Butter Fudge Day is marked on November 20\, and
  no organization appears to claim it. What can be documented is the pair o
 f things its name joins: a candy whose earliest recorded appearance is at 
 an American women's college in the 1880s\, and a ground-peanut paste paten
 ted in 1884 as an ingredient for candy. The observance is undocumented\; t
 he confection is not.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-pean
 ut-butter-fudge-day/
